Change:
  WorkerResourceEnvelope provides the checked configuration-level filesystem
  floor: disk safety watermark + checkpoint-restore temp headroom + compaction
  temp headroom. WorkerRuntimeSafetyGate supplies the stricter of its certified
  and staged envelope floors. SharedRocksDbResources passes that current floor
  to RocksDbUsageLimits on each physical-usage collection; the configured
  RocksDB floor remains active when it is stricter. A failed check from the
  owner-managed usage monitor is recorded by the existing shared safety gate.

